                <pb facs="0678" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.1211/161: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-08-28T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 28,
                                1923—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>124. Your 85, August 27, 3 P.M. It is entirely satisfactory to the Department for
                    Mr. Pani to release the statement embraced in the subquotation of the
                    Department’s 121 August 25, 6 P.M. simultaneously with the Department on Friday
                    August 31 at noon Washington time.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
